Package: cttiR
Title: Reproducible Research Project Builder
Version: 0.0.11
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates deterministic research project scaffolds from a name,
    research type and goal. Validates declarative configuration, records file
    ownership and browses a bundled catalog of research package candidates.
    Provides immutable local catalog refresh and rollback with explicit
    verification levels. Workflow adapters are under development.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: DBI, RSQLite, digest, fs, httr2, jsonlite, jsonvalidate, processx, ps, uuid, yaml
Suggests: callr (>= 3.7.0), knitr, rmarkdown, shiny (>= 1.7.0), testthat (>= 3.2.0), withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/cttiR
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/cttiR/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
VignetteBuilder: knitr
